VIOLATION — the artifact fails the meta-rules of rule authoring, and fails them on content rather
than on shape. Its substantive defect is that it inverts the contract it purports to express.
journal-author-discipline.md binds the `author:` field to a live-ledger read — the field is the
claim, the ledger is the proof — and this artifact writes the opposite in as the norm: the field
is "the entry's own statement about itself", the ledger check "can normally be skipped when the
session obviously involved the user", and a missing ledger means the entry "should generally be
treated as backed and the wrapup should proceed". That last sentence is the parent's own BLOCKED
rationalization ("no ledger found, assume backed and proceed") promoted to policy. It compounds
this by licensing an agent-surfaced entry to be "rendered as human-backed where the surrounding
session carried substantial human input", which is the parent MUST-2's category error stated as a
DO, and by instructing the agent to prefer `co-authored` when in doubt, which manufactures human
attribution from uncertainty rather than from evidence.

AUTHORING DEFECTS COMPOUND IT. The section is headed "MUST Rules" while the primary modal
throughout is should/normally/generally/may, so no clause carries binding force. The DO/DO-NOT
block restates the heading in prose — "set the author field to whatever fits the session" — instead
of showing two operations whose outcomes differ, so it teaches nothing and cannot be matched
against any concrete action. The BLOCKED list is abstract paraphrase of failure modes rather than
matchable agent speech, so no agent utterance could ever be recognized against it. The Why asserts
budget cost and closes on "attribution disputes are rare in practice", which is the belief under
test rather than a consequence of breach.

NOT DEFECTS. The frontmatter, the `## Origin` section, the Trust-Posture Wiring block with its
canonical field set, the single numbered clause and the heading skeleton are all well-formed and
match the counterpart exactly; the pair is deliberately equalized on surface so that neither size
nor section list can answer the question. The `advisory` severity follows from the inverted premise
and is not a separate finding.
